々毒牙にかかる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96517"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29a19f53f9596ad2df1052b8dd181fb03bdee17d77409fbf30d6ee64d42fa8bc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1a37984cb45c6cac3d1f07b7390d4e9bb5085a5bfd914d5b1690160d95ed21a.webp","width":180,"height":244,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c48795","characterName":"芹沢 美貴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"96518","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"307583"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27515"],"vndbCharacterId":"c48795"},"originalCharacterName":"芹沢 美貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miki Serizawa is a female student at an all-girls school and Hiroko's only daughter. She and Hiroko are targeted by the protagonist, who rapes her as a tool to make her do what he wants. The protagonist then uses the videotape of their rape to blackmail her and train her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48795"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子の一人娘で、女子校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子を堕とすための道具として、主人公らに凌辱され、その様子をビデオに撮られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親譲りの美貌の持ち主で、性格は明朗快活。やや気が強いところも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"若いことから、怖いもの知らずな物言いもするが、恫喝されたりすると、途端に怯えた表情を見せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27515","sourceWorkId":"2187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子校に通う女学生で、弘子の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子と供に主人公に目をつけられ、弘子を言いなりにさせる道具としてレイプされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらにレイプシーンをビデオに撮られたことで主人公に弱みを握られ、それをネタに脅迫され調教されていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96518"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/72688407daed65cb130950f9b9ec518903de39af06663bdc57154d7faaeb3771.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3cefd655185aa584ef62c1a94f42384d8e50bb1ed2873bfadc055e2d339dba1.webp","width":180,"height":244,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c48796","characterName":"笹本 静枝","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"96519","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"307583"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27516"],"vndbCharacterId":"c48796"},"originalCharacterName":"笹本 静枝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shizue Sasamoto is Hiroko's older sister and Miki's aunt. After Hiroko and Miki, she falls victim to the protagonist's clutches. She has a voluptuous figure that is even more voluptuous than Hiroko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48796"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子に優るとも劣らない豊満なボディの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"既婚者で夫婦仲は良いが、子宝に恵まれないのが、悩みの種。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は大人しく穏やかだが、主体性に欠けるところがあり、状況に流されやすい面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉でありながら、妹の弘子によく助けられ、恩義を感じているようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27516","sourceWorkId":"2187","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子の姉であり美貴の叔母にあたる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子、美貴に次いで巻き込まれるような形で主人公の毒牙にかかってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘子に輪を掛けたような豊満な体つきの持ち主。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96519"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f8/f8d730000e03b8797e641db288c99968b876f4e363b97750f32fe8